WEBVTT

00:01.926 --> 00:03.510
Well, I might as well.

00:03.594 --> 00:05.304
My name's Formaggio.

00:06.889 --> 00:09.141
How do you like that?
And that?! And that?! And that?!

00:09.225 --> 00:12.061
<i>That bastard wants to follow me
all the way back to the team.</i>

00:12.854 --> 00:13.855
<i>But…</i>

00:14.522 --> 00:15.898
If I can get my ass
back there alone,

00:15.940 --> 00:16.982
I'm good as gold.

00:17.108 --> 00:19.026
This mission is mine!

00:20.611 --> 00:23.113
Unless I'm hearing things,
a bomb just went off.

00:23.156 --> 00:25.324
What in the hell was that?

00:26.743 --> 00:29.287
We can get him later.
Retreat, Li'l Bomber!

00:40.631 --> 00:43.175
<i>I know that cazzo is
hiding around here somewhere,</i>

00:43.301 --> 00:45.845
<i>but I also know
I gotta get out of here.</i>

00:45.928 --> 00:47.512
<i>With all these people,</i>

00:47.597 --> 00:50.224
<i>it's not going to be pretty
when my Stand attacks.</i>

00:51.768 --> 00:54.479
Huh? The bleeding's stopped…

00:54.562 --> 00:56.814
I could have sworn that bastard
got me pretty deep.

00:57.940 --> 00:58.941
Huh?

00:59.192 --> 01:00.985
This knife…
Where the hell did it…?

01:01.027 --> 01:02.361
I don't own anything like this.

01:02.779 --> 01:05.364
This thing is practically
a machete.

01:05.448 --> 01:08.242
Where'd mine go?

01:10.787 --> 01:14.207
These shoes aren't mine, either!
They're freakin' gigantic!

01:14.290 --> 01:16.917
Where the hell did my shoes go?

01:18.377 --> 01:20.003
There's something…

01:20.338 --> 01:22.381
weird about this seat…

01:22.715 --> 01:24.967
A-And this steering wheel.

01:25.134 --> 01:27.094
I-I can't reach!

01:27.303 --> 01:30.848
I can't touch the pedal,
and the seat is crazy big!

01:31.098 --> 01:33.475
I can't even see
over the dashboard!

01:33.518 --> 01:36.771
This is bullshit…
This isn't even my car!

01:36.813 --> 01:37.563
Where is it?

01:37.563 --> 01:39.940
Where the hell is my car?
I was just in the damn thing!

01:40.399 --> 01:43.276
I'm totally stuck here
without it, merda!

01:43.528 --> 01:45.988
You must be some kind
of moron. Jesus…

01:46.072 --> 01:48.741
Wake up, your entire body
is shrinking!

01:48.825 --> 01:50.701
Looks like my powers've
finally kicked in.

01:50.785 --> 01:54.038
That little scratch I gave you
did the trick!

01:54.330 --> 01:57.416
Che cazzo, these are my shoes,
this is my knife.

01:57.500 --> 01:58.959
Which means…

02:01.170 --> 02:03.547
Finally dawned on ya, eh,
smart-ass dimwit?

02:03.589 --> 02:05.173
Sorry, your ship has sailed.

02:05.258 --> 02:08.427
You can't drive like that, fool!

02:08.678 --> 02:10.513
So this is how
that sneaking stalker guy

02:10.555 --> 02:12.431
puts his special talents to use…

02:12.515 --> 02:13.557
You don't know it yet,

02:13.599 --> 02:15.684
but you will squeal about where
the boss's daughter is hiding.

02:15.726 --> 02:17.894
Our little pissing contest
is already underway.

02:18.312 --> 02:20.605
There's no turning back now!

02:32.535 --> 02:37.035
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

02:37.874 --> 02:41.377
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

02:43.129 --> 02:47.629
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

02:48.301 --> 02:52.138
<i>But I will never give in</i>

02:52.221 --> 02:56.721
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

03:03.983 --> 03:08.483
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

03:17.079 --> 03:21.579
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

03:23.044 --> 03:27.544
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

03:30.092 --> 03:33.261
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

03:33.304 --> 03:37.804
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

03:38.559 --> 03:43.059
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

03:52.782 --> 03:57.282
EPISODE 10
HITMAN TEAM

03:55.076 --> 03:57.516
Um, should I assume
the mineral water is a no go?

03:59.246 --> 04:02.332
I'm really, really thirsty.

04:02.458 --> 04:03.208
If this continues,

04:03.250 --> 04:05.543
I can't guarantee
I will be able to carry on.

04:06.671 --> 04:10.383
Yeah, you know, I really think
we should break for lunch soon.

04:10.466 --> 04:12.342
I mean, I'm fine without,

04:12.426 --> 04:14.678
- but these guys need the nourishment.
- Feed us!

04:21.102 --> 04:23.354
He has been gone a while.

04:23.562 --> 04:27.732
This is exactly why I said
he should not be the one who goes.

04:27.900 --> 04:30.193
You just can't let it go.
Can you hear yourself…?

04:30.236 --> 04:32.988
Yes I can, and I won't
just let it go! After I—

04:34.532 --> 04:36.784
I-I'm sorry, guys.

04:45.126 --> 04:49.088
Anything Tiny Feet slices
eventually shrinks into oblivion.

04:49.171 --> 04:52.799
You just have to be a little
patient to see the results.

04:56.178 --> 04:58.430
That getup and bandanna
you're sporting

04:58.514 --> 05:00.349
is shrinking along with you.

05:00.850 --> 05:03.227
The dwindling dimensions
of your shoe and knife

05:03.310 --> 05:05.562
were halted the moment
they left your body.

05:05.688 --> 05:10.188
Simply put, your entire world is
outgrowing you at an alarming rate.

05:12.778 --> 05:16.490
O-Oh, yeah! I've gotta get a hold
of Bucciarati and the gang!

05:24.165 --> 05:27.710
Ow! What's going on
with this door?!

05:29.879 --> 05:32.339
I'm still shrinking?

05:33.591 --> 05:34.925
This door…

05:35.551 --> 05:38.262
I'm so light the opening mechanism
won't work!

05:38.554 --> 05:40.764
Esattamente, ya blockhead.

05:40.765 --> 05:41.807
Still…

05:42.058 --> 05:43.517
If I want some help,

05:43.559 --> 05:46.770
I've gotta get myself
to that phone!

05:51.942 --> 05:53.777
That's how you open a door!

06:02.244 --> 06:04.412
<i>That's a waste of effort
if I've ever seen one!</i>

06:04.580 --> 06:06.623
<i>Guess it still hasn't dawned on you</i>

06:06.707 --> 06:07.916
<i>that your wallet
and that get up you have on</i>

06:07.958 --> 06:09.709
<i>have been shrinking
right along with you.</i>

06:09.794 --> 06:13.255
<i>You can't call out without
a phone card or some coins!</i>

06:13.589 --> 06:17.801
<i>You think it's gonna work
with lilliputian sized coins!</i>

06:34.235 --> 06:36.320
NARANCIA'S HEIGHT: 62.5cm

06:36.403 --> 06:39.155
<i>Shit, looks like he actually
might have some brains in there…</i>

06:39.615 --> 06:40.490
<i>Cazzo.</i>

06:40.574 --> 06:43.493
<i>I'm gonna be in some deep merda
if his buddies find out how I work.</i>

06:44.495 --> 06:46.830
<i>And if Bucciarati
finds out about this,</i>

06:46.872 --> 06:49.499
<i>he'll just hide
the bitch somewhere else!</i>

06:49.625 --> 06:51.501
<i>That'd be a disaster!</i>

06:52.419 --> 06:53.795
Well, no frickin' way!

06:57.967 --> 06:59.468
I know he's here…

06:59.510 --> 07:01.512
I know that bastard
is around here somewhere!

07:01.554 --> 07:03.305
Where are you…?
Under here somewhere?

07:03.305 --> 07:04.055
Come on, show yourself!

07:04.098 --> 07:05.599
<i>- This is just lovely.</i>
- You down here?

07:05.641 --> 07:07.017
<i>You've got two to three minutes
before you're</i>

07:07.017 --> 07:09.519
<i>- the size of a pathetic roach.</i>
- Where are ya, scumbag?!

07:10.938 --> 07:14.524
NARANCIA'S HEIGHT: 58.0cm

07:11.147 --> 07:13.357
<i>Soon, your Stand
will be as tragically weak</i>

07:13.440 --> 07:14.546
<i>As it is laughably small.</i>

07:14.900 --> 07:18.111
<i>Then I'll really have
some fun torturing you.</i>

07:18.320 --> 07:20.655
<i>Then the inevitable,
sweet, sweet victory!</i>

07:27.246 --> 07:29.122
It's unfortunate.

07:29.165 --> 07:30.499
He'll never be able to find me,

07:30.541 --> 07:32.209
- but I still need to be patient…
- I figured it out! You're dead, dick!

07:32.334 --> 07:35.045
You're hiding in my back pocket!

07:37.506 --> 07:39.090
Gotcha, sneaky bastard…

07:39.175 --> 07:41.051
So your big power
is getting smaller…

07:41.093 --> 07:43.595
You were in there the entire time?

07:43.679 --> 07:48.179
Freakin' A,
you really are a pint sized cazzo…

07:48.475 --> 07:52.812
<i>Wait… How did he figure out
I was in his pocket?!</i>

07:53.189 --> 07:55.774
Massacre 'im, Li'l Bomber!

07:57.067 --> 07:58.401
T-Turn back!

08:03.365 --> 08:04.407
Wha—?!

08:05.117 --> 08:07.744
A b-ballpoint pen?!

08:08.162 --> 08:11.081
NARANCIA'S HEIGHT: 53.0cm

08:11.457 --> 08:13.917
Damn it! Where'd you go?!

08:14.001 --> 08:15.544
What the hell did you do?!

08:15.586 --> 08:19.506
Creepy stalker…
Dammit, where are you?!

08:22.801 --> 08:24.427
Shit, that was close.

08:24.470 --> 08:27.139
When Tiny Feet shrinks
anything other than me,

08:27.223 --> 08:30.726
I need time on my side because
of all the energy it takes.

08:30.935 --> 08:32.603
But returning things
to their original size…

08:32.686 --> 08:35.647
that's a whole other story,
just like that pen.

08:35.856 --> 08:38.567
The instantaneous repulsion created

08:38.651 --> 08:40.944
catapulted me out of his hands
and all the way over here.

08:41.528 --> 08:44.531
But how'd he figure out
that I was in his pocket?

08:44.698 --> 08:48.493
Was I moving around
too much back there?

08:52.831 --> 08:54.457
There's no way!

08:54.583 --> 08:58.044
He couldn't have seen me.
How did he do it?!

09:02.383 --> 09:03.509
There you are!

09:03.592 --> 09:05.969
You're not getting away this time,
my little stalker amico!

09:08.097 --> 09:09.306
It's gonna get me!

09:19.566 --> 09:22.151
Holy crap! Tiny Feet!

09:31.245 --> 09:34.164
W-Where'd that bastard go?!

09:42.464 --> 09:44.883
That was way too close.

09:45.009 --> 09:47.720
If it hadn't been for
that tire pressure,

09:47.803 --> 09:49.137
I'd be a dead man right now!

09:49.847 --> 09:52.516
He won't be able to—

09:53.434 --> 09:55.602
No freakin' way! Shit!

09:56.812 --> 10:01.024
<i>His Stand doesn't just blast
the shit out of everything!</i>

10:01.525 --> 10:05.529
<i>It's somehow finding me
and tracking my every move!</i>

10:10.075 --> 10:12.786
<i>He has to be using something more</i>

10:12.828 --> 10:15.997
<i>than just movement
or sound detection.</i>

10:16.165 --> 10:18.750
<i>Otherwise, how would
he've known I was in his pocket</i>

10:18.834 --> 10:22.212
<i>or that I used that blast of air.</i>

10:29.762 --> 10:32.306
Well, looky here,
you were in the drain!

10:49.406 --> 10:52.283
He can find me underwater?!

10:53.369 --> 10:55.287
Tiny Feet!

10:58.082 --> 11:02.582
<i>D-Damn it!
Think, think, think, think, think!</i>

11:04.088 --> 11:07.800
<i>This can't be happening!
Not like this! Not now!</i>

11:15.224 --> 11:18.435
<i>The Hitman Team has nine members.</i>

11:18.477 --> 11:21.188
<i>Formaggio is one of them.</i>

11:30.572 --> 11:33.533
2 YEARS AGO / NAPOLI

11:39.957 --> 11:41.625
<i>My plan is to address
the waste management crisis</i>

11:41.708 --> 11:42.875
<i>at next week's
parliamentary meeting.</i>

11:42.918 --> 11:44.044
<i>Are you really?</i>

11:44.086 --> 11:46.755
<i>Of course, I will simply inform
the minister of the environment</i>

11:46.797 --> 11:48.673
<i>of the most suitable option.</i>

11:48.757 --> 11:50.091
<i>It's the same as before.</i>

11:50.134 --> 11:53.137
<i>I just worry that
you maybe working too hard</i>

11:57.850 --> 12:00.602
<i>Don't you think you've had enough
to drink this evening?</i>

12:00.811 --> 12:02.854
<i>What the hell, Pesci?</i>

12:02.938 --> 12:04.856
<i>Are you drinking milk again?</i>

12:05.107 --> 12:09.607
<i>Espresso always
makes my tummy hurt, though.</i>

12:14.783 --> 12:18.578
<i>Then you wonder
why I call you mammoni, Pesci!</i>

12:18.912 --> 12:22.332
<i>You know, you sipping on milk
like some lame ass baby</i>

12:22.374 --> 12:24.876
<i>doesn't exactly do much
for our reputation.</i>

12:25.043 --> 12:28.963
<i>Why do you think we even brought
you along in the first place?</i>

12:29.006 --> 12:30.841
<i>Cut it out,
and get your shit together ASAP.</i>

12:31.008 --> 12:32.467
<i>O-Okay…</i>

12:32.468 --> 12:35.345
<i>So, Formaggio,
how are things going?</i>

12:36.722 --> 12:40.851
<i>That's all yours, Pesci
A little gift from me to you.</i>

12:41.643 --> 12:43.353
<i>Looks like things
are moving smoothly</i>

12:43.395 --> 12:46.523
<i>Yeah, the job's as good as done.</i>

12:47.024 --> 12:49.526
<i>Now all we have to do is sit back
and enjoy the show.</i>

12:49.610 --> 12:52.529
<i>Let's get the hell outta here
and watch some calcio.</i>

12:56.492 --> 12:58.535
NARANCIA GHIRGA
LI'L BOMBER

13:01.872 --> 13:03.373
<i>That was excellent.</i>

13:03.624 --> 13:04.791
<i>Grazie Mille, signore.</i>

13:04.833 --> 13:06.751
<i>We hope you will visit us
again soon.</i>

13:13.425 --> 13:15.885
<i>Right, let's finish this.</i>

13:16.512 --> 13:17.596
<i>That was wonderful.</i>

13:17.679 --> 13:19.055
<i>That vino biancho was stupen–</i>

13:19.890 --> 13:22.058
<i>What's wrong…?
Honey, where does it hurt?</i>

13:36.782 --> 13:38.950
<i>Hey! You think
you can park your ass here?!</i>

13:39.034 --> 13:40.410
<i>Get outta the way!</i>

13:40.494 --> 13:42.913
<i>Hey, what the hell is seeping out
from under the car?</i>

13:43.038 --> 13:45.665
<i>- It's freak in blood!
- Come on, I think it's time we bounce.</i>

13:47.209 --> 13:50.170
<i>What's the matter, Pesci?
Something wrong with your legs?</i>

13:53.549 --> 13:54.925
<i>We're back!</i>

13:57.261 --> 13:58.428
<i>How'd it go?</i>

13:58.554 --> 14:00.097
<i>Perfect!</i>

14:00.180 --> 14:02.682
<i>Bastard's nothing
but a bunch of smoke now.</i>

14:02.808 --> 14:06.144
<i>But you ended up offing that bitch
who was tagging along too.</i>

14:06.395 --> 14:10.524
<i>Guess your good-for-nothin' Stand
is good for something, after all.</i>

14:10.607 --> 14:13.776
<i>Keep talk in…
You got a problem with it, you do it.</i>

14:13.819 --> 14:16.530
<i>- Hey, I'd love to, but the leader
- Melone, how much was this job?</i>

14:16.530 --> 14:17.822
<i>- Wants me to keep it tucked away
- Melone, how much was this job?</i>

14:17.906 --> 14:19.365
<i>- For a very special occasion.
- Twenty million lira.</i>

14:19.449 --> 14:20.783
<i>Damn, that's cheap!</i>

14:20.826 --> 14:25.288
<i>Ghiaccio, take it easy,
we can talk finances later.</i>

14:25.581 --> 14:27.332
<i>We've got bigger issues…</i>

14:27.583 --> 14:29.334
<i>Like where the hell
are Sorbet and Gelato?</i>

14:29.418 --> 14:31.294
<i>Are they playing hooky?</i>

14:31.336 --> 14:34.088
<i>Maybe they're making sweet,
sweet love somewhere.</i>

14:34.131 --> 14:36.299
<i>They're together, right?</i>

14:36.383 --> 14:38.593
<i>Do you do anything other than talk?</i>

14:38.927 --> 14:41.262
<i>Something is strange here.</i>

14:41.305 --> 14:42.931
<i>Gelato's one thing,</i>

14:42.973 --> 14:45.141
<i>Sorbet definitely likes
his money, though.</i>

14:45.267 --> 14:49.479
<i>He always shows up
to claim his cut.</i>

14:51.398 --> 14:55.610
<i>There comes a time in the life of
every established organization when</i>

14:55.652 --> 14:59.322
<i>the rebels rise up
against the leaders.</i>

15:00.073 --> 15:03.117
<i>And when smuggling drugs from
Central Asia to Europe and the US</i>

15:03.160 --> 15:05.829
<i>can be done so
at extremely low costs,</i>

15:05.871 --> 15:07.539
<i>a profit often tens, sometimes
hundreds, of times more valuable</i>

15:07.623 --> 15:09.166
<i>than the original price
can be made,</i>

15:09.249 --> 15:11.668
<i>leading to the all
but guaranteed phenomenon of</i>

15:11.752 --> 15:13.795
<i>the emboldened and
money-hungry risk-taker,</i>

15:13.837 --> 15:15.672
<i>who attempts to seize
the drug lord's territory,</i>

15:15.714 --> 15:17.674
<i>even at the cost of his own life.</i>

15:21.136 --> 15:22.345
<i>Did you find them?</i>

15:22.387 --> 15:25.098
<i>No, there's no sign of them.</i>

15:25.140 --> 15:27.308
<i>They must've been
exterminated, then.</i>

15:27.476 --> 15:29.519
<i>That's what they get for
trying to sniff out the boss!</i>

15:29.811 --> 15:31.229
<i>It's a possibility</i>

15:32.064 --> 15:34.191
<i>They're both freakin' nut cases,
that's for sure.</i>

15:35.025 --> 15:37.444
<i>Polpo controls all
gambling activities.</i>

15:37.527 --> 15:40.029
<i>Those goons handling the drugs
are making a killing, too.</i>

15:40.155 --> 15:42.198
<i>But us losers working for
the Hitman Team</i>

15:42.282 --> 15:44.033
<i>have to contend with
chump change from the boss!</i>

15:44.117 --> 15:45.868
<i>Well it doesn't sit well with me!</i>

15:45.911 --> 15:48.788
<i>There ain't anyone better than us
in the famiglia! No one!</i>

15:49.164 --> 15:52.709
<i>We deserve way better!</i>

15:59.966 --> 16:02.093
<i>So it was asphyxiation?</i>

16:02.177 --> 16:05.638
<i>Yeah… Just Gelato, though.</i>

16:05.931 --> 16:07.641
<i>We don't have Sorbet's body.</i>

16:15.357 --> 16:18.068
"PUNISHMENT"

16:16.400 --> 16:17.567
<i>Punishment…</i>

16:18.527 --> 16:19.986
<i>Several days later,</i>

16:20.028 --> 16:24.528
<i>a shipment of anonymous packages
arrived at the team's doorstep.</i>

16:25.659 --> 16:28.411
<i>What the hell? Again?</i>

16:28.495 --> 16:30.830
<i>Who's sending these things?!</i>

16:31.623 --> 16:32.915
<i>Frames?</i>

16:33.500 --> 16:34.918
<i>This thing isn't a painting.</i>

16:34.960 --> 16:37.420
<i>Is this some kind of
modern art or something?</i>

16:37.462 --> 16:39.422
<i>They've got something weird
floating in them.</i>

16:43.093 --> 16:43.843
<i>Hey!</i>

16:44.302 --> 16:48.802
<i>Th-That's the same color nail polish
that Sorbet always wears!</i>

16:49.725 --> 16:51.977
<i>I-I've seen it before…</i>

16:52.060 --> 16:54.145
<i>He and Gelato use the same shade!</i>

16:56.314 --> 16:58.566
<i>Get the frames off
and line them up.</i>

17:04.489 --> 17:08.075
<i>Thirty six works of art had arrived
at the team's hideout.</i>

17:08.827 --> 17:10.119
<i>Hey, hey, hey…</i>

17:10.162 --> 17:12.414
<i>This's gotta be some kind of joke…</i>

17:18.420 --> 17:20.255
<i>I can't look at
these things anymore!</i>

17:20.297 --> 17:21.464
<i>Quit your crying!</i>

17:27.387 --> 17:28.471
<i>That's…</i>

17:37.689 --> 17:39.607
<i>The transparent slabs
held Sorbet's body,</i>

17:39.649 --> 17:41.359
<i>sliced and preserved
in formaldehyde.</i>

17:41.943 --> 17:44.654
<i>Together, the slices formed
a face contorted in terror.</i>

17:44.738 --> 17:46.865
<i>The face of a man
who suffered the effects</i>

17:46.948 --> 17:50.201
<i>of a razor sharp blade
from his toes to his head</i>

17:51.787 --> 17:54.414
<i>It was a way of sharpening
and pro longing the pain.</i>

17:54.456 --> 17:58.956
<i>For the Hitman Team,
it was a day of revelation.</i>

18:01.254 --> 18:03.172
<i>D-Do you think that Sorbet</i>

18:03.799 --> 18:07.260
<i>was sliced up
right in front of Gelato?</i>

18:07.302 --> 18:11.222
<i>Yeah, the fear and anguish
must have driven him to…</i>

18:11.306 --> 18:12.640
<i>The gag…</i>

18:12.724 --> 18:16.185
<i>He must've swallowed it down
to suffocate himself!</i>

18:18.480 --> 18:19.814
<i>Without speaking a word,</i>

18:19.856 --> 18:21.774
<i>the boss had made
his message clear.</i>

18:27.948 --> 18:28.949
<i>Listen up…</i>

18:29.574 --> 18:33.077
<i>From this moment on,
Sorbet and Gelato never existed</i>

18:33.495 --> 18:37.373
<i>The team knew and accepted
that they were on thin ice.</i>

18:37.833 --> 18:42.087
<i>Uncovering the boss's true identity
was off the table.</i>

18:43.672 --> 18:45.799
<i>At least, until…</i>

18:46.341 --> 18:49.344
<i>news of the boss's daughter
reached their ears.</i>

18:58.061 --> 19:01.647
<i>Like hell I'm gonna die
like a rat in here!</i>

19:01.857 --> 19:05.151
<i>The boss and
his sweet drug business is ours!</i>

19:05.193 --> 19:08.196
<i>We're gonna claw our way
all the way up to the top!</i>

19:11.658 --> 19:12.909
<i>It's riddled with holes?</i>

19:13.368 --> 19:15.953
<i>He shot that rat to death? Why?</i>

19:21.001 --> 19:23.420
C-Could it be…?

19:31.720 --> 19:33.555
<i>It went the other way</i>

19:33.722 --> 19:35.932
<i>It's trying to weed me out.</i>

19:37.058 --> 19:39.435
<i>Respiration… That's it!</i>

19:39.769 --> 19:43.606
<i>Narancia's Stand detects and
follows its victim's respiration!</i>

19:44.065 --> 19:48.565
<i>Mosquitoes feed on
the blood of their victims</i>

19:48.653 --> 19:50.946
<i>by detecting the carbon dioxide
they give off</i>

19:51.072 --> 19:52.573
<i>That's how he's finding me!</i>

19:52.616 --> 19:55.035
<i>That's how he found me
in his pocket!</i>

19:55.410 --> 19:59.497
<i>That must have been why he gave up
the hunt back in the alleyway</i>

19:59.581 --> 20:01.624
<i>when all those onlookers
crawled out of the woodwork.</i>

20:01.666 --> 20:04.126
<i>He could have blown away
an innocent bystander!</i>

20:04.544 --> 20:07.213
<i>It was tracking my breathing!</i>

20:10.258 --> 20:11.300
There you are!

20:12.886 --> 20:14.304
He shot again!

20:14.387 --> 20:15.971
Looks like he can't
tell the difference

20:16.056 --> 20:17.766
between me and the rats.

20:17.933 --> 20:18.934
In that case…

20:22.395 --> 20:25.147
<i>Look at them…
Disgusting excuse for a mammal…</i>

20:26.900 --> 20:31.070
There are so many of them…
And their movements…

20:31.529 --> 20:35.157
I must be tracking
a pack of rats!

20:35.200 --> 20:36.993
They're all traveling
at the same speed!

20:37.035 --> 20:38.828
Moving in exactly the same way!

20:38.912 --> 20:39.913
You were a threat…

20:40.121 --> 20:42.123
Until I figured out
how your stupid powers worked.

20:42.165 --> 20:44.041
I thought long and hard about
how you could find me…

20:44.125 --> 20:45.668
Now that I know that,

20:45.835 --> 20:49.338
you are about as worrisome
as a mosquito,

20:49.631 --> 20:51.716
Narancia!

20:55.512 --> 20:57.347
I win, Narancia!

20:57.430 --> 20:59.140
I'm gonna make like a rat on shit

20:59.182 --> 21:01.642
and slip outta here to wait for you
to shrink into oblivion!

21:05.146 --> 21:07.231
H-How?

21:07.857 --> 21:09.358
It's the beauty of the pack…

21:09.567 --> 21:11.527
All of them move in the same way.

21:11.611 --> 21:16.111
But there seemed to be one rat
really huffing and puffing…

21:18.451 --> 21:21.871
Are you tired?
You're out of breath.

21:21.871 --> 21:25.249
Could there be a little traveler
tagging along on your back?

21:25.291 --> 21:26.542
What the hell…

21:26.626 --> 21:30.212
I'm feeling lucky, and a little
target practice might do me good!

21:30.255 --> 21:31.256
Shit!

21:37.804 --> 21:39.180
Yes, a direct hit!

21:43.601 --> 21:45.394
Th-That was close…

21:45.478 --> 21:47.104
If I hadn't returned to
my normal size,

21:47.188 --> 21:48.731
I would've been done for!

21:49.274 --> 21:50.358
If time hadn't been on my side,

21:50.400 --> 21:54.529
and you hadn't shrunk to
a diminutive weakling…

21:51.693 --> 21:55.988
NARANCIA'S HEIGHT: 13.2cm

21:54.654 --> 21:56.010
I would've been a goner!

21:56.322 --> 21:58.532
I-I didn't get him!

21:58.575 --> 22:03.075
Could my Stand's power have
shrunk along with my size?

22:03.830 --> 22:07.041
How the hell do I
shoot him dead now?!

23:38.258 --> 23:42.136
EPISODE 11
NARANCIA'S LI'L BOMBER
